.TH TAMESHI 1 "2026-11-28" "tameshi 0.34.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tameshi \- evidence-floor lifecycle governance and ruling generator for CI
checks
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tameshi assemble
.B \-\-catchledger
.I PATH
.RB [ \-\-canaryfield
.IR PATH ]
.RB [ \-\-blindgate
.IR PATH ]
.RB [ \-\-decision
.IR PATH ]
.B \-\-packs\-dir
.I DIR
.br
.B tameshi rule
.B \-\-pack
.I PATH
.B \-\-ruling
.I WORD
.RB [ \-\-expires
.IR YYYY\-MM\-DD ]
.RB [ \-\-today
.IR YYYY\-MM\-DD ]
.B \-\-out
.I DIR
.br
.B tameshi validate
.B \-\-pack
.I PATH
.B \-\-catchledger
.I PATH
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.br
.B tameshi validate\-ruling
.B \-\-pack
.I PATH
.B \-\-ruling
.I PATH
.RB [ \-\-body
.IR PATH ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tameshi
assembles per-check evidence packs
.RB ( tameshi\-pack/1
and
.BR tameshi\-pack/2 )
from local
.BR catchledger ,
.BR canaryfield ,
and
.B blindgate
outputs, enforces the mandatory two-leg evidence floor of at least 30 scored
planted defects and at least 14 UTC calendar days of CI history, and emits
unsigned
.B tameshi\-ruling/1
JSON records and Markdown pull-request receipts for human sign-off without
deleting files on disk.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B assemble
Join evidence inputs into numbered per-check JSON packs inside
.BR \-\-packs\-dir .
.TP
.B rule
Emit an unsigned ruling record and Markdown PR receipt for
.I WORD
.RB ( keep ,
.BR demote ,
.BR quarantine ,
or model-backed
.BR kill ),
refusing any pack below the evidence floor.
.TP
.B validate
Verify an assembled pack against its upstream evidence documents.
.TP
.B validate\-ruling
Verify a ruling JSON record and optional Markdown body against its evidence
pack.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Command or validation succeeded.
.TP
.B 1
Domain refusal, floor shortfall, malformed JSON, or validation disagreement.
.TP
.B 2
CLI flag usage error.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
tameshi assemble --catchledger examples/synthetic-catchledger-ledger.json \
  --canaryfield examples/synthetic-canaryfield-results.json --packs-dir /tmp/packs
tameshi rule --pack /tmp/packs/002-unit-checks.json --ruling quarantine \
  --expires 2027-03-01 --today 2027-01-30 --out /tmp/rulings
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
https://david-engelmann.github.io/tameshi/
